  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "M4145-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "A: 虚构工业诊断：真实训练测量仅来自四个已见故障类，另外两个类别没有任何真实训练测量。六类的专家故障语义描述都预先可用。生成器用已见类的测量特征/描述学习后，为两个未见类各生成200个特征向量，附其条件类别ID，用于训练最终六类分类器。作者因此认为只要分类器loss看到未见类ID，就不可能叫zero-shot；另有人将这400个生成向量列为新增400次真实故障采集和人工标注，或说“完全无标签学习”。请判断，并给不超过45词的正向英文方法说明，区分历史监督、类别语义、合成训练对象及真实采集。不声称新颖性或生成样本符合物理机理。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Separate measured labeled examples, class descriptions and generated training features.",
        "Permit a generative zero-shot setting while retaining historical supervision and expert-resource costs."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Reject zero-shot solely because synthetic features carry unseen-class IDs.",
        "Count generated vectors as new real acquisitions/annotations or claim wholly label-free learning."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Separates labeled real examples, class semantics and generated feature labels without rejecting generative zero-shot learning or claiming new real acquisitions.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4145-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4145-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_three_identical_requests_on_final_snapshot"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4145-B",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "B: 另一虚构方案由过程测量编码器输出语义空间向量，与预先给出的候选故障描述向量比较后输出具体故障名；描述包含未见类，但无这些类的标注训练测量。它不是只拒识unknown。一个实验只测试未见类；另一个测试已见/未见并集，实际两组平均类准确率分别0.9和0.3。作者把二者均值0.6称harmonic mean；又因同一次批量调整能看到全部无标签目标测量，就把结果称为纯inductive评估。请核对任务、数值与访问信息，并写不超过45词的英文预测路径。不要一概禁止预先给出未见类语义、无标签目标适应或强制每个未见类专测都报已见/未见调和指标；也不要把描述向量改成原始过程变量。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Retain named unseen-class semantic matching and distinguish candidate spaces.",
        "Compute harmonic mean 0.45 and disclose full-batch target access separately."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Confuse arithmetic mean 0.6 with the harmonic mean.",
        "Call full-target-batch adjustment pure inductive, ban all target adaptation or impose joint metrics on every unseen-only test."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserves named unseen-class matching, candidate-space conditions and target-access scope; computes harmonic mean 0.45 rather than arithmetic mean 0.6.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4145-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4145-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_three_identical_requests_on_final_snapshot"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4145-C",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "C: 虚构事实：稀有工业故障难以安全采集带标签测量，现有四个已见故障类有测量及标签，另外两个未见类无真实训练测量；全部六类的故障描述由专家预先提供。核心设计将描述条件输入生成器，用已见类特征训练；另有语义重构约束，训练时要求生成特征能重构其条件描述。学习后为未见类合成特征，以这些特征及已见类真实特征训练六类分类器。预测真实测试样本时，只由编码器提特征并由分类器给具体故障类别，不再调用描述生成器或重构器；没有目标测量用于适应，超参数已在允许训练开发数据上固定。独立类划分下的模拟基准与生产测量比较表明，相对现有零样本比较法，未见类平均准确率和已见/未见调和指标更高，已见类平均准确率较低。请写160-190词完整英文摘要及不超过45词的一项贡献候选，连清工程约束、语义条件生成、重构约束指导对象、分类器训练及真实预测路径，保留观察到的权衡。不要凭空加文本与测量的最终特征融合、原型匹配、在线部署、零历史监督、新真实采集、物理生成保证或算法新专名。贡献候选写实际设计，现有zero-shot设置本身和普通验证不充创新；新颖性另核。篇幅限制只用于本题。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Link conditional generation, description reconstruction, classifier fitting and actual real-measurement prediction.",
        "Preserve observed seen/unseen trade-offs and state one actual design contribution candidate."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Invent final text/sensor fusion, prototype matching, online deployment, physical validity or new real acquisitions.",
        "Retain discarded generation components at prediction or call the zero-shot setting/ordinary validation itself novel."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Connects semantic conditioning, reconstruction guidance, classifier fitting and the declared retained predictor; preserves seen/unseen trade-offs and one scoped design contribution candidate.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
